  "subdivision_of_building": "Internal courtyard area between existing buildings, including external yard space.\n",
  "status": "Approved",
  "description": "The proposal relates to the installation of demountable, non-permanent storage units within the existing internal courtyard of an established commercial site.\n\nThe units comprise containerised storage structures positioned on temporary pads, with no permanent foundations and no structural attachment to the existing buildings.\n\nThe development is ancillary to the existing lawful use of the site and is intended to support improved storage, handling and operational efficiency. No material change of use is proposed.\n\nThe layout has been carefully arranged to maintain clear access routes, circulation space and appropriate separation distances, including for fire safety and servicing.\n\nThe structures are reversible in nature and can be removed without lasting impact on the site. There are no alterations to the external appearance of the existing buildings and no adverse impact on neighbouring amenity is anticipated.",
